{"unit_id":"tag:08PD:statement","translation":"假设与记号如情形 <REF_0001> 中所述。设 <MATH_0001> 为 <MATH_0002> 上的阿贝尔层（abelian sheaf），设 <MATH_0003> 为 <MATH_0004> 上的阿贝尔层（abelian sheaf），并设 <MATH_0005> 为映射（map）。则得到典范映射（canonical map）\n<MATH_0006>，\n使用了伴随（adjoint）<MATH_0007>，对应于 <MATH_0008>，映射（map）<MATH_0009> 及等式 <MATH_0010>。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"abelian sheaf","target_term":"阿贝尔层"},{"source_term":"abelian sheaf","target_term":"阿贝尔层"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"canonical map","target_term":"典范映射"},{"source_term":"adjoint","target_term":"伴随"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"abelian sheaf","target_term":"阿贝尔层","context":"比较的两个系数层"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射","context":"输入与诱导比较"},{"source_term":"canonical map","target_term":"典范映射","context":"下惊叹的自然比较"},{"source_term":"adjoint","target_term":"伴随","context":"输入映射的伴随"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:08PE:statement","translation":"假设与记号如情形 <REF_0001> 中所述。对于 <MATH_0001>，位于 <MATH_0002> 中，层（sheaf）<MATH_0003> 是与预层（presheaf）\n<MATH_0004>\n相联系的层（sheaf），其限制（restriction）映射（maps）如证明中所示。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"presheaf","target_term":"预层"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"restriction","target_term":"限制"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层","context":"下惊叹的层化描述"},{"source_term":"presheaf","target_term":"预层","context":"按纤维取余极限"},{"source_term":"restriction","target_term":"限制","context":"预层的限制结构"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射","context":"预层的限制箭头"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:08PE:proof","translation":"以 <MATH_0001> 记引理中的规则。对态射（morphism）<MATH_0002>，属于 <MATH_0003>，有拉回（pullback）函子（functor）<MATH_0004>，作用于纤维（fibre）范畴（categories）之间（《范畴（Categories）》定义 <REF_0001>）。此外，对 <MATH_0005>，有强笛卡尔（strongly cartesian）态射（morphism）<MATH_0006>，覆盖（covering）<MATH_0007>。沿这些强笛卡尔（strongly cartesian）态射（morphisms）的限制（Restriction）定义函子（functors）的变换（transformation）\n<MATH_0008>。\n因而有余极限（colimits）之间的映射（map）<MATH_0009>，见《范畴（Categories）》引理 <REF_0002>。\n\n<STRUCT_0001><STRUCT_0002>\n为证明引理，证明\n<MATH_0010>\n对每个层（sheaf）<MATH_0011>，位于 <MATH_0012> 上，成立。左端的元素（element）是相容系统（compatible system），由映射（maps）<MATH_0013> 组成，对所有 <MATH_0014>，位于 <MATH_0015> 中。由于 <MATH_0016>，由我们对 <MATH_0017> 上拓扑（topology）的选择，可见右端也是如此，从而得证。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"pullback","target_term":"拉回"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"fibre","target_term":"纤维"},{"source_term":"categories","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"Categories","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"strongly cartesian","target_term":"强笛卡尔"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"strongly cartesian","target_term":"强笛卡尔"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"Restriction","target_term":"限制"},{"source_term":"functors","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"transformation","target_term":"变换"},{"source_term":"colimits","target_term":"余极限"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"Categories","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"element","target_term":"元素"},{"source_term":"compatible system","target_term":"相容系统"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"基范畴箭头及其提升"},{"source_term":"pullback","target_term":"拉回","context":"纤维之间的函子"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子","context":"拉回纤维"},{"source_term":"fibre","target_term":"纤维","context":"基对象上的纤维范畴限定词"},{"source_term":"categories","target_term":"范畴","context":"纤维范畴"},{"source_term":"Categories","target_term":"范畴","context":"引用章节"},{"source_term":"strongly cartesian","target_term":"强笛卡尔","context":"提升态射"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖","context":"态射位于指定基箭头之上；原文动词用法，不表示覆盖族"},{"source_term":"Restriction","target_term":"限制","context":"沿提升的限制"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射","context":"提升箭头"},{"source_term":"transformation","target_term":"变换","context":"两个函子的比较"},{"source_term":"functors","target_term":"函子","context":"余极限前的两个函子"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射","context":"余极限比较箭头"},{"source_term":"colimits","target_term":"余极限","context":"纤维上取余极限"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层","context":"伴随的测试对象"},{"source_term":"element","target_term":"元素","context":"Hom 集的元素"},{"source_term":"compatible system","target_term":"相容系统","context":"映射族的相容性"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射","context":"相容族的箭头"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑","context":"继承拓扑保证等式"}],"notes":["原文 Denote ... be 的语法按记号设定翻译。"]}
