{"unit_id":"tag:08RW:prose-0001","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n对于点（point）上的范畴（category），我们将左导出下惊叹（left derived lower shriek）函子（functors）命名为同调（homology）函子（functors）。\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"point","target_term":"点"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"left derived lower shriek","target_term":"左导出下惊叹"},{"source_term":"functors","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"homology","target_term":"同调"},{"source_term":"functors","target_term":"函子"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴","context":"基为点的范畴"},{"source_term":"point","target_term":"点","context":"只有一个对象和箭头的基"},{"source_term":"left derived lower shriek","target_term":"左导出下惊叹","context":"命名为同调的导出构造"},{"source_term":"functors","target_term":"函子","context":"左导出与同调函子"},{"source_term":"homology","target_term":"同调","context":"本节的命名"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:08PF:statement","translation":"点（point）上的范畴（Category）<OWNARGEND_0001>设 <MATH_0001> 为范畴（category）。赋予 <MATH_0002> 混沌（chaotic）拓扑（topology）（《位点（Sites）》例 <REF_0001>）。因而预层（presheaves）与层（sheaves）在 <MATH_0003> 上一致。函子（functor）<MATH_0004>，其中 <MATH_0005> 为只有一个对象（object）和一个态射（morphism）的范畴（category），是余连续（cocontinuous）且连续（continuous）的。设 <MATH_0006> 为对应的拓扑斯的态射（morphism of topoi）。设 <MATH_0007> 为环（ring）。赋予 <MATH_0008> 环层（sheaf of rings）<MATH_0009>，并赋予 <MATH_0010> 以 <MATH_0011>，将其记为 <MATH_0012>。这样，\n<MATH_0013>\n是情形 <REF_0002> 的例子。由注记 <REF_0003>，不必区分 <MATH_0014> 在模（modules）上或阿贝尔层（abelian sheaves）上的作用。由引理 <REF_0004>，可见\n<MATH_0015>。\n所以 <MATH_0016> 是取余极限（colimits）的第 <MATH_0017> 个左导出函子（derived functor）。下面写作\n<MATH_0018>，\n并将它命名为 <TEXTITOPEN_0001>第 <MATH_0019> 个同调（homology）群（group），属于 <MATH_0020><TEXTITCLOSE_0001>，在 <MATH_0021> 上。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"point","target_term":"点"},{"source_term":"Category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"chaotic","target_term":"混沌"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"Sites","target_term":"位点"},{"source_term":"presheaves","target_term":"预层"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"cocontinuous","target_term":"余连续"},{"source_term":"continuous","target_term":"连续"},{"source_term":"morphism of topoi","target_term":"拓扑斯的态射"},{"source_term":"ring","target_term":"环"},{"source_term":"sheaf of rings","target_term":"环层"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"abelian sheaves","target_term":"阿贝尔层"},{"source_term":"colimits","target_term":"余极限"},{"source_term":"derived functor","target_term":"导出函子"},{"source_term":"homology","target_term":"同调"},{"source_term":"group","target_term":"群"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"Cat